  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5901.08 Assistant instructor",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.08 “Assistant instructor” means a person who assists the emergency medical services instructor coordinator of any lesson in the demonstration and practice designed to develop and evaluate student skill competencies.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19; ss by #13953, eff 4-30-24",
